PALESTINIAN, MILITANTS, STRIKES\par \par \uc2 NUCLEAR, POWER PLANT, UKRAINE, KOTIN\par \par \uc2 US, CHINA, TENSIONS, POLICY, TAIWAN\par \par \uc2 MINERS, TRAPPED, SCUBA DIVERS, RESCUE\par \par \uc2 HOUSE, FIRE, BAKER\par \par \uc2 CRASH, CAR, LINTON\par \par \uc2 FILM CLIP: "THE DEVIL WEARS PRADA"\par \par \uc2 HECHE, CAR, CRASH, HOME\par \par \uc2 JONES, HOAX, PUNITIVE, LEWIS\par \par \uc2 E-BIKE, LAWSUIT, PARENTS, DAUGHTER, STEINSAPIR, RAD\par \par \uc2 KARDASHIAN, DAVIDSON\par \par \uc2 CORGIS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GMA PLAY OF THE DAY\par \par \uc2 MONKEYPOX, VACCINES, OUTBREAK\par \par \uc2 TREATMENT, BREAST CANCER, FUNK, ENHERTU\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: \uc2 FDA\uc2  APPROVES BREAST CANCER DRUG\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FIRST TARGETED THERAPY FOR HER-2-LOW BREAST CANCER\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Well, now to the \uc2 FDA\uc2  approving a breast cancer treatment that could affect nearly half of all patients.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) It's the first targeting a major subcategory of breast cancer that most patients don't even know exists. Breast cancer surgeon Dr. Kristi Funk joins us with more. Thank you so much for being with us this morning, doctor.\par \par \uc2 DR KRISTI FUNK (AUTHOR "BREASTS: THE OWNER'S MANUAL" / PINK LOTUS)\par \par \uc2 Good morning, Eva. Good to be here.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) So, let's start, just break it down for us, is this therapy a game changer?\par \par \uc2 DR KRISTI FUNK (AUTHOR "BREASTS: THE OWNER'S MANUAL" / PINK LOTUS)\par \par \uc2 It absolutely is. So, it's called Enhertu. And it's the first ever \uc2 FDA\uc2 -approved medicine specifically targeting patients with HER-2-low breast cancer. What's that? It's a very new subtype of breast cancer that 50% of all invasive cancers fall into. So, HER-2 is a receptor that sits on the outside of cancer cells and can cause them to grow. 15% to 20% of breast cancer patients have an abundance of these receptors. They're HER-2 positive, they're usually treated with chemo and the drug Herceptin. All right, of the 80% that aren't HER-2, 60% of those actually do have an appreciable number, but not enough to be HER-2-positive. So, these are now the HER-2 lows and the drug Herceptin doesn't work in them.\par \par \uc2 DR KRISTI FUNK (AUTHOR "BREASTS: THE OWNER'S MANUAL" / PINK LOTUS)\par \par \uc2 But now, all these HER-2 lows can benefit from Enhertu. It's the newly proven antibody chemo drug combo that prolongs life and makes it harder for disease to progress in stage 4 HER-2 lows. This is a highly effective option for all metastatic patients who are about to find out they're HER-2-low and not HER-2-negative.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: WHICH PATIENTS COULD THE THERAPY HELP?\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And so, for those diagnosed with metastatic breast cancer, should they be looking into this?\par \par \uc2 DR KRISTI FUNK (AUTHOR "BREASTS: THE OWNER'S MANUAL" / PINK LOTUS)\par \par \uc2 Oh, absolutely. So, all you need to do, you can find out with your doctor but you can just look at your pathology report. You want to look at the immunohistochemistry score, the IHC HER-2 score. If it's zero, then actually are negative. But 60% of you will be a 1 plus or a 2 plus that reflects to another test called FISH that will have been negative. So, you are either 1 plus or 2 plus and you are actually HER-2-low and might be eligible for Enhertu.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Sounds like it's going to be very helpful for a lot of people. Dr. Funk, thank you for being with us.\par \par \uc2 DR KRISTI FUNK (AUTHOR "BREASTS: THE OWNER'S MANUAL" / PINK LOTUS)\par \par \uc2 Thank you.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Janai?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GMA MORNING MENU\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: IN 4 MINS, FAN FALLOUT\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Also, still coming up here on "GMA," the fan fallout over the "Batgirl" movie being shelved and what it all signals in the world of streaming.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: IN 7 MINS, NEW LEASH ON LIFE\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Plus, 4,000 beagles in search of their forever homes. Inside the pups' historic rescue.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: IN 9 MINS, TREAT YOURSELF\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) And treat yourself. Tory Johnson in the house with "Deals & Steals." We'll be right back.\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) A Little 50 Cent, okay. Welcome back to "GMA." Just when you thought your clubbing days were over, NFTs join the party.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NFT NIGHTLIFE, COMING UP\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Coming up, how non-fungible tokens are now creating new nightlife experiences outside the metaverse, whatever any of that means.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) You're the OG, you really are the clubbing days are over.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) There are some people trying to figure out what that entire sentence means. We'll have more on all of it coming up in the show.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) You can relive your glory days.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) My glory days? Nobody wants to relive those.\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) In the club.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020220823ei860000n\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 DOG DAYS OF SUMMER BEAGLE RESCUE\b0\par\par\uc2 690 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 August 2022\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BREAKING OVERNIGHT: STRANDED IN DEATH VALLEY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: STRANDED IN DEATH VALLEY NATIONAL PARK\par \par \uc2 DEATH VALLEY, RAINFALL, FLOODING\par \par \uc2 FLIGHTS, CANCELED, DELAYED, WEATHER\par \par \uc2 SENATE, VOTE, BILL, CLIMATE CHANGE, HEALTH, TAXES\par \par \uc2 HIRING, RECESSION, JOBS\par \par \uc2 MONKEYPOX, OUTBREAK, DAYCARE, SEATON, SUTTON\par \par \uc2 ISRAELI, GAZA, PALESTINIAN, MILITANTS, STRIKES\par \par \uc2 NUCLEAR, POWER PLANT, UKRAINE, KOTIN\par \par \uc2 US, CHINA, TENSIONS, POLICY, TAIWAN\par \par \uc2 MINERS, TRAPPED, SCUBA DIVERS, RESCUE\par \par \uc2 HOUSE, FIRE, BAKER\par \par \uc2 CRASH, CAR, LINTON\par \par \uc2 FILM CLIP: "THE DEVIL WEARS PRADA"\par \par \uc2 HECHE, CAR, CRASH, HOME\par \par \uc2 JONES, HOAX, PUNITIVE, LEWIS\par \par \uc2 E-BIKE, LAWSUIT, PARENTS, DAUGHTER, STEINSAPIR, RAD\par \par \uc2 KARDASHIAN, DAVIDSON\par \par \uc2 CORGIS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GMA PLAY OF THE DAY\par \par \uc2 MONKEYPOX, VACCINES, OUTBREAK\par \par \uc2 TREATMENT, BREAST CANCER, FUNK, ENHERTU\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: \uc2 FDA\uc2  APPROVES BREAST CANCER DRUG\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FIRST TARGETED THERAPY FOR HER-2-LOW BREAST CANCER\par \par \uc2 "BATGIRL"\par \par \uc2 ABI-HASSAN, DOGS, RESCUE, BEAGLE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DOG DAYS OF SUMMER\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All right, well now to the dog days of summer. "GMA" kicking off Dogust all week long, celebrating the work of shelters all over the country, helping more than 80 pups find their forever homes. And this morning, the history-making rescue of thousands of beagles and the search to find each one a family. Take a look.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) It's the historic dog rescue operation that's given nearly 4,000 beagles a new leash on life. \uc2 The Humane Society of the United States\uc2  taking on its biggest undertaking yet, rescuing thousands of hungry, sick and mistreated dogs that were bound for animal testing labs.\par \par \uc2 MIGUEL ABI-HASSAN (CHIEF ANIMAL RESCUE CARE AND SANCTUARY OFFICER)\par \par \uc2 Right now, we've mobilized about half of those. They're on their way to shelters. Some have already been adopted to forever homes. Others are at our care and rehab center.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) This transfer plan comes as a result of a May lawsuit filed by the Department of Justice against Envigo, a pharmaceutical and biotech company, alleging Animal Welfare Act violations at the facility. In a settlement with the DOJ last month, Envigo did not admit wrongdoing but closed one of its facilities.\par \par \uc2 STAFF (FEMALE)\par \par \uc2 Oh, boy.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) \uc2 The Humane Society of the United States\uc2  leading the charge. Miguel Abi-Hassan, the chief animal rescue care and sanctuary officer, says it's one of the largest operations to date.\par \par \uc2 MIGUEL ABI-HASSAN (CHIEF ANIMAL RESCUE CARE AND SANCTUARY OFFICER)\par \par \uc2 Ultimately 4,000 beagles is a very large number to wrap your head around and we couldn't do this work alone. We're very fortunate to have a very large network of financial partners. Those are some of your local humane societies that you may know.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) The nonprofit wasting no time, coordinating doggie transports starting in mid-July, finding shelters across the country who could make space and help find forever homes. No easy task as summer is typically a time of year when shelters are already overcrowded.\par \par \uc2 STAFF (FEMALE)\par \par \uc2 It's all okay now, sweetie.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) But there are glimmers of hope in this effort. Pria and Jersey, two of the 43 beagles relocated to San Diego now adopted and living their best lives.\par \par \uc2 MIGUEL ABI-HASSAN (CHIEF ANIMAL RESCUE CARE AND SANCTUARY OFFICER)\par \par \uc2 It is very heartwarming when you see them touch grass for the first time, when you see them play and interact and just get a taste of what the rest of their life is going to look like.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Aww, those adorable pups. And if you're interested in adopting one of those beagles, you can go to humanesociety.org for a list of the shelters receiving them and then contact the shelters directly. I also have a foster dog, Johnny, who I believe is part beagle. So, if anybody is interested in that, he's available as well.\par \par \uc2 WHIT JOHNSON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Let's get over to Janai for "Deals & Steals."\par \par \uc2 JANAI NORMAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And if you weren't going to mention the Johnson family foster game, I was going to, Whit. Thank you very much.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020220823ei860000p\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 DEALS & STEALS KICK BACK AND RELAX WITH CHILL SAVINGS\b0\par\par\uc2 827 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 August 2022\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BREAKING OVERNIGHT: STRANDED IN DEATH VALLEY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: STRANDED IN DEATH VALLEY NATIONAL PARK\par \par \uc2 DEATH VALLEY, RAINFALL, FLOODING\par \par \uc2 FLIGHTS, CANCELED, DELAYED, WEATHER\par \par \uc2 SENATE, VOTE, BILL, CLIMATE CHANGE, HEALTH, TAXES\par \par \uc2 HIRING, RECESSION, JOBS\par \par \uc2 MONKEYPOX, OUTBREAK, DAYCARE, SEATON, SUTTON\par \par \uc2 ISRAELI, GAZA, PALESTINIAN, MILITANTS, STRIKES\par \par \uc2 NUCLEAR, POWER PLANT, UKRAINE, KOTIN\par \par \uc2 US, CHINA, TENSIONS, POLICY, TAIWAN\par \par \uc2 MINERS, TRAPPED, SCUBA DIVERS, RESCUE\par \par \uc2 HOUSE, FIRE, BAKER\par \par \uc2 CRASH, CAR, LINTON\par \par \uc2 FILM CLIP: "THE DEVIL WEARS PRADA"\par \par \uc2 HECHE, CAR, CRASH, HOME\par \par \uc2 JONES, HOAX, PUNITIVE, LEWIS\par \par \uc2 E-BIKE, LAWSUIT, PARENTS, DAUGHTER, STEINSAPIR, RAD\par \par \uc2 KARDASHIAN, DAVI